<title>FRANCE: Hermes 1996 net rises 13.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Hermes 1996 net rises 13.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			   457.0  vs	   404.0</p>
<p>    Operating				    753.3  vs	   684.5</p>
<p>    Turnover				   4,183.0  vs	 3,826.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Luxury goods firm Hermes gave its results in a statement. It said net attributable profit rose 13.1 percent over 1995. Turnover rose 9.3 percent over the prior year, or 11.3 percent on constant exchange rates.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
